        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to restore the fertility of your town's land, play the role of Nikolos, a reckless young man who, with the <strong>blessing of the goddess Demeter</strong>, can <strong>change the seasons</strong>. Put your <strong>observation</strong> and <strong>logic</strong> skills to good use in this single-player <strong>3D puzzle game</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather <strong>offerings</strong> from the various scenery so that Demeter can help you find your way, collect <strong>scrolls</strong> that hold mysterious secrets and find a way out of <strong>complex situations</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of <strong>challenges</strong> await you, from pressure plates to pendulum swings, you'll need to <strong>solve multiple mechanisms</strong> to progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is the result of a <strong>final year project</strong>, now available on Steam! We hope you will enjoy it — have fun, and don't hesitate to <strong>share your feedback</strong> with us!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to restore the fertility of your town's land, play the role of Nikolos, a reckless young man who, with the <strong>blessing of the goddess Demeter</strong>, can <strong>change the seasons</strong>. Put your <strong>observation</strong> and <strong>logic</strong> skills to good use in this single-player <strong>3D puzzle game</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather <strong>offerings</strong> from the various scenery so that Demeter can help you find your way, collect <strong>scrolls</strong> that hold mysterious secrets and find a way out of <strong>complex situations</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of <strong>challenges</strong> await you, from pressure plates to pendulum swings, you'll need to <strong>solve multiple mechanisms</strong> to progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is the result of a <strong>final year project</strong>, now available on Steam! We hope you will enjoy it — have fun, and don't hesitate to <strong>share your feedback</strong> with us!</p>",
        "short_description": "In order to restore the fertility of your town's land, play the role of a reckless young man who, with Demeter's blessing, can change the seasons. Put your observation and logic skills to good use in this single-player 3D puzzle game!",
